---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy for the SunHestia website." path="legal/privacy">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--c-ink-soft)">Last updated: August 2026</p>
      <p>
        This policy describes how SunHestia handles information collected through
        this website. We collect only what is necessary to respond to enquiries
        and to operate the site — typically the details you submit through the
        contact form (name, email, country, and your message).
      </p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Information you provide directly, such as contact requests, and basic
        technical data (such as anonymised analytics) used to understand how the
        site is used.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To respond to your enquiry, to provide information about our products, and to improve the website.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your country, you may have rights to access, correct or
        delete your personal data. To exercise them, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:info@sunhestia.com">info@sunhestia.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p>This is a summary policy; a complete version will be provided before any production deployment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
